{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11109030","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11109030","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1110903001:0":{"text":"Hand it over.","source_cn":"拿来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9AE7950B5290CDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110903002:0":{"text":"What?","source_cn":"什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB029872C7364B1C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110903003:0":{"text":"Don't you know the rules? All newbies in town for the treasure must pay an information fee.","source_cn":"懂不懂规矩？来咸水镇做宝藏生意的新人，都要交情报费。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x402596F76FF774EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110903004:0":{"text":"You'll be informed as soon as we hear anything. Likewise, you are obliged to share everything with us.","source_cn":"要是听到风声，我们会知会你们一声，同样，要是你们打听到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DA50B972CA033C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110903005:0":{"text":"When the treasure is uncovered, those who provided a lead will get a share.","source_cn":"等真找到了宝藏，提供消息的人能拿到分成。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18CA66D6FAD2FA86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"",